{"nodes": [{"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_doc", "label": "Uni Hub Design", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_migration_4", "label": "Migration 4 (semesters, classes, class_id/type/revised_at)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Additive only; v3 code ignores extra tables; no down-migration, take SQLite backup before deploy."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_on_delete_cascade_class_id", "label": "ON DELETE CASCADE on class_id", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deleting a class or semester is one DELETE; SQLite cascades semester -> classes -> todos -> checklist items and rules. Manual deletes in a transaction buy nothing but code (R2, Rue: \"all gone\")."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_type_check_final", "label": "Type CHECK is final", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Changing a CHECK later needs a table rebuild that would cascade-delete checklist items; follow migration 3 TEMP-table pattern if ever needed (R3)."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_uni_aspect_setting", "label": "uni_aspect_id setting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Copies the IT-projects getItAspectId pattern: aspects are user-created so Uni has no fixed id; read with a join so a deleted aspect reads as unset."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_link_follows_aspect", "label": "Class link follows the aspect (in SQL)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "updateTodo/deleteAspect clear class/type/revised whenever the resulting aspect is not the Uni aspect, regardless of UI."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_todowritable", "label": "todoWritable helper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One helper in uni.ts returns archived when the todo class belongs to an archived semester; /todos calls it before every editing todo-id action."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_server_side_read_only", "label": "Server-side read-only enforcement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "R4: read-only enforced only in UI was a risk; every class/todo/rule write is guarded on the server. Single-todo delete stays allowed since scope only forbids add/edit."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_archive_transaction", "label": "Archive semester transaction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One transaction: set open class todos done with completed_at now, then set archived_at; the dialog is a UI step only."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_two_todo_read_models", "label": "Two todo read models (todoColumns / selectTodos)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "R1: both read models must map new fields or they drift; a unit test per path."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_color_icon_picker", "label": "ColorIconPicker extraction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Picker extracted from AspectForm into ui/ColorIconPicker.svelte using $props.id() so two pickers on one page do not collide (R6)."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_rail_layout_pattern", "label": "RailLayout rail / in-column pattern", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Detail and overview rails use RailLayout at >=1280 px and render the same content in the column below, no overlay toggle (project-detail pattern)."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_uni_server_contract", "label": "uni.ts server contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-uni-hub/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_10_04_uni_hub_design_grade_summary", "label": "gradeSummary (ECTS-weighted average)", 